@startuml
title Features: Cart, Orders & Reporting
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "Order Engine" as OrdersAPI
participant "Billing/ERP API" as BillingAPI
participant "Report Service" as Analytics

== Feature 17, 18: Cart & Warehouse Sourcing ==

User -> Browser: Add Product to Cart (Carrello)
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/cart
BFF -> OrdersAPI: Add item & calculate real-time totals
OrdersAPI -> BFF: Cart updated

User -> Browser: Checkout (Ordini dal magazzino)
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/checkout?source=magazzino_ospedaliero
BFF -> OrdersAPI: Create Order (Deduct from internal warehouse)
OrdersAPI -> Flow: Trigger fulfillment logic
OrdersAPI -> BFF: 201 Created (Order ID)
BFF -> Browser: Order Confirmation Page

== Feature 19, 21, 22: Historical Docs (Invoices & DDT) ==

User -> Browser: View Order History (Storico Ordini)
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/orders/history
BFF -> OrdersAPI: GET /orders?user_id={id}
OrdersAPI -> BFF: Past Orders Data
BFF -> Browser: Render Order Table

User -> Browser: Download DDT or Invoice
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/documents/{type}/{id}/download (Feat 19, 21)
BFF -> BillingAPI: Fetch generated PDF blob/URI
BillingAPI -> BFF: PDF Document stream
BFF -> Browser: Trigger File Download

== Feature 23: Analytics and Reporting ==

User -> Browser: Open Analysis/Report Dashboards
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/reports/purchases?period=last_30_days
BFF -> Analytics: Request aggregated purchase dataset
Analytics -> BFF: JSON Aggregated Metrics
BFF -> Browser: Render Charts & Tables

User -> Browser: Export Report to CSV/Excel
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/reports/export
BFF -> Analytics: Generate Excel Dump
Analytics -> BFF: File Stream
BFF -> Browser: Trigger File Download

@enduml
